  "body": "**Link to problem area**: https://spec.matrix.org/unstable/rooms/v11/#authorization-rules\n\n**Issue**\n\nWe should have:\n\n> Add auth rule: “If any auth event has a `room_id` which doesn’t match our `room_id`, reject”.\n\nSynapse [implements](https://github.com/element-hq/synapse/blob/9d43bec/synapse/event_auth.py#L234) this already, but it should be clarified in the spec.\n",
